{"spec": "ACP v1. Authentication (https://agentclientprotocol.com/protocol/v1/authentication): methods without a type are the agent's own flow; the client calls authenticate with a methodId and must not call it for a terminal method. The method list is the one codex-acp advertises (src/CodexAuthMethod.ts on main, read 2026-11-13: chat-gpt, api-key, gateway; the gateway needs data a client supplies, so rvim never sends it). A failed authenticate is an error response; this machine then offers the methods again. Timing of authenticate relative to session/new is UNVERIFIED (see PLAN.md)."}
{"event": "connect", "cwd": "/home/user/project", "at": 0, "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "initialize", "params": {"protocolVersion": 1, "clientCapabilities": {"fs": {"readTextFile": false, "writeTextFile": false}, "terminal": false}, "clientInfo": {"name": "rvim", "version": "<any>"}}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 5, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"protocolVersion": 1, "agentCapabilities": {}, "authMethods": [{"id": "api-key", "name": "API Key", "description": "Use an API key to authenticate"}, {"id": "chat-gpt", "name": "ChatGPT", "description": "Use ChatGPT to authenticate"}, {"id": "gateway", "name": "Custom model gateway"}]}}, "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "session/new", "params": {"cwd": "/home/user/project", "mcpServers": []}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 10, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "error": {"code": -32000, "message": "Authentication required"}}, "expect": [{"notice": "auth_required", "methods": [{"id": "api-key", "name": "API Key", "terminal": false}, {"id": "chat-gpt", "name": "ChatGPT", "terminal": false}, {"id": "gateway", "name": "Custom model gateway", "terminal": false}]}], "state": "NeedsAuth"}
{"event": "authenticate", "at": 20, "method": "gateway", "expect": [{"notice": "request_failed", "turn": null, "message": "authentication method gateway needs data this client does not provide"}], "state": "NeedsAuth"}
{"event": "authenticate", "at": 25, "method": "chat-gpt", "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "authenticate", "params": {"methodId": "chat-gpt"}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 30000, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "error": {"code": -32000, "message": "Sign-in did not complete"}}, "expect": [{"notice": "request_failed", "turn": null, "message": "authenticate failed: Sign-in did not complete"}, {"notice": "auth_required", "methods": [{"id": "api-key", "name": "API Key", "terminal": false}, {"id": "chat-gpt", "name": "ChatGPT", "terminal": false}, {"id": "gateway", "name": "Custom model gateway", "terminal": false}]}], "state": "NeedsAuth"}
{"event": "authenticate", "at": 31000, "method": "chat-gpt", "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "method": "authenticate", "params": {"methodId": "chat-gpt"}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 40000, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {}}, "expect": [{"notice": "authenticated"}, {"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "method": "session/new", "params": {"cwd": "/home/user/project", "mcpServers": []}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 40010, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"sessionId": "sess_after_login"}}, "expect": [{"notice": "connected", "session": "sess_after_login"}], "state": "Ready"}
